# An or query sends no side query, so the search can't name the files it
# skipped.
args: search 'repo:sego-fake/unlisted-or (foo or zzqqxx)'
exit: 0
--- stdout
1 match  1 repo  0.1 s
query  repo:sego-fake/unlisted-or (foo or zzqqxx)

github.com/sego-fake/unlisted-or@0123456789ab:main.go
1:foo
--- stderr
sego: note: the search can't tell which files it skipped; files over 1 MiB and files with too many distinct trigrams are never searched
